@segment   balloon
@title     Resonant Energy Balloon
@levels    F10
@duration  ~3m
@protected Resonant Energy Balloon, REBAL

say You are now ready to create your Resonant Energy Balloon. A moving field of your own energy that surrounds and protects you.
pause 5
say Let the energy you've built rise gently out the top of your head, like a fountain cascading down and around your body, spiralling gently as it descends.
pause 6
say Some strands fall straight, others spiral clockwise, and some counterclockwise. Allow the energy to wrap around you completely, and re-enter through the soles of your feet.
hold 30
say You are now inside your own Resonant Energy Balloon.
pause 4
say This living energy field performs two important functions.
pause 3
say First. It holds in and concentrates your own energy, so you can direct it as needed.
pause 4
say Second. It protects you from external energies, unless you consciously open to receive them.
pause 5
say Take a moment now to feel its strength and softness. Feel how it supports and surrounds you.
pause 10
say To recreate your REBAL at any time. Inhale deeply. Visualise a circle with the number ten inside.
pause 4
say Then exhale, and imagine blowing that circle outward around you. Your balloon will instantly form again.
pause 5
say To dissolve it, simply inhale, and imagine the glowing circle returning into your body.
pause 6
